# The build context is the repo root (see Dockerfile). BuildKit reads this file
# in place of a root .dockerignore, and only for this Dockerfile. Send server/
# and web/ alone, without anything a local build left behind.
*
!server/
!web/
server/bin/
server/cmd/habitcraft/spa/dist/
web/node_modules/
web/coverage/
**/*.md
!server/cmd/habitcraft/spa/README.md
